      textHtml: `<h3>The Cat and the Fox</h3><p>One day, a cat <span class="keyword-tooltip" data-tooltip="piyoda sayr qildi">hiked</span> on a mountain. When he reached the <span class="keyword-tooltip" data-tooltip="cho'qqiga">peak</span>, he met a fox. They began talking about how they get away from their enemies.</p><p>“I am very smart. I have <span class="keyword-tooltip" data-tooltip="milliardlab">billions</span> of ideas. I can <span class="keyword-tooltip" data-tooltip="o'yib yasash, kavlamoq">carve</span> a <span class="keyword-tooltip" data-tooltip="juda kichik, kichkina">tiny</span> hole in a tree, and then climb in,” the fox said. He added, “I have a lot of friends. If I am in trouble, I can call them to <span class="keyword-tooltip" data-tooltip="qarzga/yordamga bermoq">lend</span> their help. I can escape an entire <span class="keyword-tooltip" data-tooltip="armiya, qo'shin">army</span> if I have to!”</p><p>Then, the fox asked, “What are your <span class="keyword-tooltip" data-tooltip="ehtimoliy, potentsial">potential</span> plans?” The cat said, “I have only one plan.” The fox said, “I hope you have good <span class="keyword-tooltip" data-tooltip="omad, baxt">fortune</span>, then! Do you want me to be your <span class="keyword-tooltip" data-tooltip="repetitor, murabbiy">tutor</span>? I can teach you many things.” The cat said, “I <span class="keyword-tooltip" data-tooltip="kafolat beraman">guarantee</span> that my plan works every time. We can <span class="keyword-tooltip" data-tooltip="to'xtatish, bas qilish">quit</span> talking about it.”</p><p>Soon, they saw a group of wolves. It was an <span class="keyword-tooltip" data-tooltip="favqulodda vaziyat">emergency</span>. The cat quickly used her plan. She ran up a tree. The fox could not decide which plan to use. “What should my <span class="keyword-tooltip" data-tooltip="boshlang'ich, birinchi">initial</span> move be? Should I <span class="keyword-tooltip" data-tooltip="maslahatlashmoq">consult</span> my friends?” The fox felt <span class="keyword-tooltip" data-tooltip="kuchli">intense</span> <span class="keyword-tooltip" data-tooltip="xavotir, tashvish">anxiety</span>. All he could do was <span class="keyword-tooltip" data-tooltip="aylanmoq">spin</span> in a circle. The wolves caught the fox. The cat was full of <span class="keyword-tooltip" data-tooltip="faxr, g'urur">pride</span>. This is <span class="keyword-tooltip" data-tooltip="isbot, dalil">proof</span> that having a good plan is better than having many bad plans.</p>`,
      videoUrl: "https://www.youtube.com/embed/JVZepC6g2gc?si=PbDfBEJqpVeU__HF",
      keywordsList: [{ word: "anxiety", translation: "xavotir, tashvish" }, { word: "army", translation: "armiya, qo'shin" }, { word: "billion", translation: "milliard" }, { word: "carve", translation: "o'ymoq, kesib shakl bermoq" }, { word: "consult", translation: "maslahatlashmoq" }, { word: "emergency", translation: "favqulodda vaziyat" }, { word: "fortune", translation: "omad, baxt" }, { word: "guarantee", translation: "kafolat bermoq" }, { word: "hike", translation: "piyoda sayr qilmoq (tog'da)" }, { word: "initial", translation: "boshlang'ich, birinchi" }, { word: "intense", translation: "kuchli, jiddiy" }, { word: "lend", translation: "qarzga bermoq, yordam qo'lini cho'zmoq" }, { word: "peak", translation: "cho'qqi" }, { word: "potential", translation: "ehtimoliy, potentsial" }, { word: "pride", translation: "g'urur, iftixor" }, { word: "proof", translation: "isbot, dalil" }, { word: "quit", translation: "to'xtatmoq, bas qilmoq" }, { word: "spin", translation: "aylanmoq, gir-gir aylanmoq" }, { word: "tiny", translation: "juda kichik, kichkina" }, { word: "tutor", translation: "repetitor, shaxsiy o'qituvchi" }],
      testUrl: "https://slike7236-hash.github.io/universal-quiz-server/?lesson=ess2_13",
