  title: "Prince Sam",
  gamesTitle: "GAMELAR RO'YXATI",
  textHtml: `<h3>Prince Sam</h3><p>Sam's mother cooked at the royal palace. One day, he went to work with her. She <span class="keyword-tooltip" data-tooltip="alohida ta'kidladi">emphasized</span> that he should stay in the kitchen. But Sam was bored. <span class="keyword-tooltip" data-tooltip="shu sababli, shuning uchun">Thus</span>, he decided to look around.</p><p>He went around a corner. It <span class="keyword-tooltip" data-tooltip="shokda qoldirdi, hayratda qoldirdi">shocked</span> him to see a boy who had a strong <span class="keyword-tooltip" data-tooltip="o'xshashlik">likeness</span> to him. Sam soon <span class="keyword-tooltip" data-tooltip="o'ziga keldi">recovered</span>. The other boy <span class="keyword-tooltip" data-tooltip="tikilib qaradi">stared</span> at him. Then he spoke. “Come with me.”</p><p>He needed to be <span class="keyword-tooltip" data-tooltip="aqlli, mulohazali">rational</span>. But he couldn't <span class="keyword-tooltip" data-tooltip="inkor etmoq, rad etmoq">deny</span> that he wanted to go. So he followed the boy to a <span class="keyword-tooltip" data-tooltip="xonaga, xonadorga">chamber</span>. “I am Prince Bertram,” the boy said.</p><p>Sam felt <span class="keyword-tooltip" data-tooltip="uyatchang, tortinchoq">shy</span> talking to a prince. “I'm Sam.”</p><p>“Trade places with me.” The prince said.</p><p>“We can't. My mother will kill me. <span class="keyword-tooltip" data-tooltip="qolaversa, bundan tashqari">Moreover</span>, I don't know anything about being a prince.”</p><p>“No one will find out,” the prince <span class="keyword-tooltip" data-tooltip="gapini bo'ldi">interrupted</span>. “We look the same, and even our <span class="keyword-tooltip" data-tooltip="ishora/xatti-harakatlarimiz">gestures</span> are the same. It will only <span class="keyword-tooltip" data-tooltip="davom etadi">last</span> for a week.”</p><p>Sam said OK. Soon, Sam's <span class="keyword-tooltip" data-tooltip="qarashlari, nuqtai nazari">perspective</span> on being a prince changed. He spent most of his day signing royal <span class="keyword-tooltip" data-tooltip="hujujatlarni">documents</span>. At night, the prince's chamber was cold. He thought he was going to <span class="keyword-tooltip" data-tooltip="muzlab qolmoq">freeze</span> or get sick with a <span class="keyword-tooltip" data-tooltip="isitma, harorat">fever</span> or the <span class="keyword-tooltip" data-tooltip="gripp">flu</span>. He was happy when the week ended. So was the prince.</p><p>“I didn't know how to do anything,” the prince said. “I've always <span class="keyword-tooltip" data-tooltip="suyanganman, tayanganman">relied</span> on my servants to do everything for me.”</p><p>“I think I like being a regular person,” Sam said. “Being a prince isn't fun.” So, they both returned to their normal positions and enjoyed their lives more than before.</p>`,
  videoUrl: "https://www.youtube.com/embed/6h7frCL5wCw?si=t5G7nRe-wl9-NBoi",
  keywordsList: [{ word: "chamber", translation: "xona, yotoqxona" }, { word: "deny", translation: "inkor etmoq, rad etmoq" }, { word: "document", translation: "hujjat" }, { word: "emphasize", translation: "alohida ta'kidlamoq" }, { word: "fever", translation: "isitma, yuqori harorat" }, { word: "flu", translation: "gripp" }, { word: "freeze", translation: "muzlamoq, soqotmoq" }, { word: "gesture", translation: "ishora, xatti-harakat" }, { word: "interrupt", translation: "gapni bo'lmoq, xalaqit bermoq" }, { word: "last", translation: "davom etmoq, yetmoq" }, { word: "likeness", translation: "o'xshashlik" }, { word: "moreover", translation: "qolaversa, bundan tashqari" }, { word: "perspective", translation: "nuqtai nazar, qarash" }, { word: "rational", translation: "mantiqli, mulohazali" }, { word: "recover", translation: "tuzalmoq, o'ziga kelmoq" }, { word: "rely", translation: "suyanmoq, tayanmoq" }, { word: "shock", translation: "hayratda qoldirmoq, shok qilmoq" }, { word: "shy", translation: "uyatchang, tortinchoq" }, { word: "stare", translation: "tikilib qaramoq" }, { word: "thus", translation: "shuning uchun, shu sababli" }],
  testUrl: "https://slike7236-hash.github.io/universal-quiz-server/?lesson=ess2_16",
