      title: "From the Earth to the Stars",
      gamesTitle: "СПИСОК ИГР",
      textHtml: `<h3>From the Earth to the Stars</h3><p>Jeremy was from a family of <span class="keyword-tooltip" data-tooltip="шахтеров">miners</span>. Like them, he worked <span class="keyword-tooltip" data-tooltip="под землей">underground</span> during the day. His job was to gather <span class="keyword-tooltip" data-tooltip="необработанные">raw</span> <span class="keyword-tooltip" data-tooltip="минералы">minerals</span> and <span class="keyword-tooltip" data-tooltip="драгоценности">jewels</span>. Each night after work, he lay <span class="keyword-tooltip" data-tooltip="бодрствующим">awake</span> in an open field. With his <span class="keyword-tooltip" data-tooltip="телескопом">telescope</span>, he looked at the stars. He was amazed by the <span class="keyword-tooltip" data-tooltip="масштабом">scale</span> of space. He wished someday he might travel there.</p><p>One day there was an accident in the mine. Water <span class="keyword-tooltip" data-tooltip="хлынула">poured</span> into the mine. Everything was dark. Jeremy <span class="keyword-tooltip" data-tooltip="вытянулся">stretched</span> out and grabbed a piece of wood. It kept him from sinking. Jeremy felt a <span class="keyword-tooltip" data-tooltip="присутствие">presence</span> nearby.</p><p>“I am an angel,” said a voice.</p><p>“What?” Jeremy exclaimed.</p><p>“You must never come underground again. Have the <span class="keyword-tooltip" data-tooltip="смелость">courage</span> to make your wishes come true.”</p><p>For a long time he <span class="keyword-tooltip" data-tooltip="плыл, держался на воде">floated</span> in silence. Then he heard other voices. The other miners were coming to rescue him.</p><p>The next day Jeremy <span class="keyword-tooltip" data-tooltip="пропустил">skipped</span> work. He decided to become an <span class="keyword-tooltip" data-tooltip="космонавтом">astronaut</span>. For the next two years, he studied hard. One day, he was given <span class="keyword-tooltip" data-tooltip="разрешение">permission</span> to <span class="keyword-tooltip" data-tooltip="участвовать">participate</span> in a mission to space. His wish had been <span class="keyword-tooltip" data-tooltip="исполнено">granted</span>.</p><p>His spaceship left the ground. It went higher until there was no more <span class="keyword-tooltip" data-tooltip="гравитации">gravity</span>. He saw <span class="keyword-tooltip" data-tooltip="спутники">satellites</span> floating next to the ship.</p><p>Then Jeremy saw a beautiful angel outside his spaceship. It smiled at Jeremy. For some minutes, Jeremy could not speak. Finally, he said, “Thank you.”</p>`,
      videoUrl: "https://www.youtube.com/embed/7IJRQ7EB8tc",
      keywordsList: [{ word: "astronaut", translation: "астронавт, космонавт" }, { word: "awake", translation: "бодрствующий, не спящий" }, { word: "courage", translation: "смелость, мужество" }, { word: "float", translation: "плавать, держаться на воде" }, { word: "grant", translation: "предоставлять, даровать, исполнять" }, { word: "gravity", translation: "гравитация, сила тяжести" }, { word: "jewel", translation: "драгоценный камень, сокровище" }, { word: "miner", translation: "шахтер, горняк" }, { word: "mineral", translation: "минерал, полезное ископаемое" }, { word: "participate", translation: "участвовать, принимать участие" }, { word: "permission", translation: "разрешение, позволение" }, { word: "pour", translation: "лить, литься, наливать" }, { word: "presence", translation: "присутствие" }, { word: "raw", translation: "сырой, необработанный" }, { word: "satellite", translation: "спутник" }, { word: "scale", translation: "масштаб, шкала" }, { word: "skip", translation: "пропускать" }, { word: "stretch", translation: "тянуть, растягивать, вытягиваться" }, { word: "telescope", translation: "телескоп" }, { word: "underground", translation: "подземный, под землей" }],
      testUrl: "https://slike7236-hash.github.io/universal-quiz-server/?lesson=ess2_21",
      games: { matchup: "...", anagrama: "...", typeanswer: "...", wordsearch: "...", pair: "..." }
