      title: "The Forest People",
      gamesTitle: "СПИСОК ИГР",
      textHtml: `<h3>The Forest People</h3><p>Colonel Wilbur and his wife Mary were flying over the <span class="keyword-tooltip" data-tooltip="тропики">tropics</span> in their private plane. But suddenly the engine caught fire. It was impossible to <span class="keyword-tooltip" data-tooltip="тушить (огонь)">extinguish</span> the fire, so they were forced to land in the forest.</p><p>&ldquo;What are we going to do?&rdquo; said Mary. &ldquo;Can you fix the plane?&rdquo;</p><p>Wilbur said, &ldquo;That&rsquo;s impossible. I am not a <span class="keyword-tooltip" data-tooltip="техник, специалист">technician</span>, and the plane is out of gasoline. We&rsquo;ll have to find help.&rdquo;</p><p>Wilbur and Mary walked through the forest. It was difficult to find a path through the trees. Mary even tore her dress on sharp thorns. Suddenly, they saw some huts and lots of <span class="keyword-tooltip" data-tooltip="миниатюрный, крошечный">miniature</span> people, cooking and making weapons with <span class="keyword-tooltip" data-tooltip="кремень">flint</span>.</p><p>&ldquo;I&rsquo;ll ask them for help,&rdquo; said Wilbur.</p><p>&ldquo;No! Don&rsquo;t go! They are <span class="keyword-tooltip" data-tooltip="деформированный, с уродствами">deformed</span>!&rdquo; said Mary. &ldquo;They&rsquo;ll <span class="keyword-tooltip" data-tooltip="донимать, изводить, тревожить">harass</span> us! They may have a <span class="keyword-tooltip" data-tooltip="заразный, инфекционный">contagious</span> virus that will make us sick! We won&rsquo;t know how to <span class="keyword-tooltip" data-tooltip="лечить, вылечить">cure</span> it. We&rsquo;ll surely end up as <span class="keyword-tooltip" data-tooltip="трупы">corpses</span>!&rdquo;</p><p>Wilbur tried to persuade Mary to go to the forest people, but she refused to <span class="keyword-tooltip" data-tooltip="интегрироваться, объединяться">integrate</span> with them. She had the <span class="keyword-tooltip" data-tooltip="предположение, допущение">assumption</span> that the small people were dangerous. &ldquo;Let&rsquo;s keep walking. We&rsquo;re sure to find someone sooner or later.&rdquo;</p><p>For three days, the couple searched, but they found no one who could help them in their <span class="keyword-tooltip" data-tooltip="кризис">crisis</span>. It was uncomfortable, and they were hungry without any source of <span class="keyword-tooltip" data-tooltip="питание">nutrition</span>. Plus, the forest was filled with dangerous <span class="keyword-tooltip" data-tooltip="зверь, хищник">beasts</span>. Finally, Mary agreed to return to the forest people.</p><p>When Wilbur and Mary arrived at the village, the forest people immediately welcomed them. They gave them bread made from <span class="keyword-tooltip" data-tooltip="ячмень">barley</span> to eat and a place to sleep. The next day, the forest people led Wilbur and Mary through the trees, and they <span class="keyword-tooltip" data-tooltip="быстро, вовремя">promptly</span> arrived at a small town. From there, they took a bus to the city where they found an <span class="keyword-tooltip" data-tooltip="посольство">embassy</span>.</p><p>Mary was sorry that she had not trusted the forest people sooner. She learned the value of not <span class="keyword-tooltip" data-tooltip="дискриминировать, ущемлять">discriminating</span> against people who are different.</p>`,
      videoUrl: "https://www.youtube.com/embed/8DLzxSsFBd0",
      keywordsList: [{ word: "assumption", translation: "предположение" }, { word: "barley", translation: "ячмень" }, { word: "beast", translation: "зверь, хищник" }, { word: "colonel", translation: "полковник" }, { word: "contagious", translation: "заразный" }, { word: "corpse", translation: "труп" }, { word: "crisis", translation: "кризис" }, { word: "cure", translation: "лечить, лекарство" }, { word: "deformed", translation: "деформированный" }, { word: "discriminate", translation: "дискриминировать" }, { word: "embassy", translation: "посольство" }, { word: "extinguish", translation: "тушить" }, { word: "flint", translation: "кремень" }, { word: "harass", translation: "изводить, докучать" }, { word: "integrate", translation: "интегрироваться" }, { word: "miniature", translation: "миниатюрный" }, { word: "nutrition", translation: "питание" }, { word: "promptly", translation: "быстро, сразу" }, { word: "technician", translation: "техник" }, { word: "tropics", translation: "тропики" }],
      testUrl: "https://slike7236-hash.github.io/universal-quiz-server/?lesson=ess4_26",
      games: { matchup: "...", anagrama: "...", typeanswer: "...", wordsearch: "...", pair: "..." }
